From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chromium-blink-ios <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] iOS extensions: prepare and import a publisher-signed CRX

Verify a private CRX3 snapshot with Chromium publisher proof, then stage
bounded Manifest V3 contents with the signing key bound to the ID.
Expose a one-time review token before calling the trusted installer.
The install is session-only until the profile supports restoration.

---
